# A cast spent in place of a swing when the character drops low, exactly as the
# Cleric's Heal is -- see fight.h. GMS's own figures, 20 + 3L% of the pool,
# which tops out at half of it rather than the Cleric's whole.
#
# The penalty for casting it again soon after is dropped: the user asked for it
# out, and a fight paid in expected damage has no clock to charge it against.
name: "HP Recovery"
skill_order: 2
description: "Instantly recovers your HP."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_WHITE_KNIGHT
max_level: 10
base_delay_ms: 720
base { heal_pct: 0.23 }
per_level { heal_pct: 0.03 }
